    "Details": " Built for both ComStar and the Word of Blake in 3067, the Thug 12E is a redesign of the Thug 11E with the aim of extending it’s accuracy and range. The traditional PPCs have been upgraded to ER PPCs and an improved C3 computer has been added. To make the change to a C3i computer, a double heat sink, one ton of ammunition, and the corresponding CASE were removed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Energy</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>",
